        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Nightmare. Shape the Chaos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome aboard the <strong>Sea of Dreams</strong>—a haunted vessel adrift in a nightmare realm. In this intense <strong>action rogue-lite</strong>, you'll battle through endless waves of twisted enemies in a fight for survival. Will you make it out alive—or become just another lost soul?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slay. Adapt. Overcome.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>9 unique survivors</strong>, each with distinct abilities. Blast through hundreds of nightmarish foes with an arsenal of <strong>17 powerful weapons</strong>—from flamethrowers to throwing tantos. Gain <strong>XP</strong>, unlock devastating <strong>perks</strong>, and build unstoppable combos as the chaos ramps up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Rogue-lite with Relentless Momentum</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a chance to grow stronger. Earn <strong>permanent upgrades</strong>, climb <strong>20 ranks</strong>, and craft the perfect build with <strong>15+ game-changing perks</strong>. Fail or succeed—progression is always yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484590/extras/4f39eb338fed0739ce68779cec919f24.poster.avif?t=1761423635\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484590/extras/4f39eb338fed0739ce68779cec919f24.webm?t=1761423635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484590/extras/4f39eb338fed0739ce68779cec919f24.mp4?t=1761423635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>17 Unique Weapons</strong> – Flamethrowers, rocket launchers, sniper rifles, and more. Build your perfect loadout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 Playable Characters</strong> – Each with their own traits. Find your favorite survivor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20 Ranks to Climb</strong> – Unlock rewards, perks, and upgrades with every level gained.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15+ Perks</strong> – Mix and match to create devastating builds: offensive, defensive, and everything in between.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>16+ Enemy Types</strong> – Face horrors from The Other World with deadly attack patterns and evolving behaviors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Distinct Levels</strong> – Battle through terrifying environments aboard the Sea of Dreams.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Custom Game Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat the campaign to unlock a fully tweakable experience. Adjust everything—from difficulty to weapon count, enemy scaling, and more. Create your own challenge or total chaos. <strong>Your nightmare, your rules.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Difficulty Settings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're here for the story or the pain, choose from multiple difficulty levels—<strong>Easy to Legendary</strong>. Higher risk, greater rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The nightmare begins. Will you survive the Sea of Dreams?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Nightmare. Shape the Chaos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome aboard the <strong>Sea of Dreams</strong>—a haunted vessel adrift in a nightmare realm. In this intense <strong>action rogue-lite</strong>, you'll battle through endless waves of twisted enemies in a fight for survival. Will you make it out alive—or become just another lost soul?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slay. Adapt. Overcome.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>9 unique survivors</strong>, each with distinct abilities. Blast through hundreds of nightmarish foes with an arsenal of <strong>17 powerful weapons</strong>—from flamethrowers to throwing tantos. Gain <strong>XP</strong>, unlock devastating <strong>perks</strong>, and build unstoppable combos as the chaos ramps up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Rogue-lite with Relentless Momentum</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a chance to grow stronger. Earn <strong>permanent upgrades</strong>, climb <strong>20 ranks</strong>, and craft the perfect build with <strong>15+ game-changing perks</strong>. Fail or succeed—progression is always yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484590/extras/4f39eb338fed0739ce68779cec919f24.poster.avif?t=1761423635\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484590/extras/4f39eb338fed0739ce68779cec919f24.webm?t=1761423635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484590/extras/4f39eb338fed0739ce68779cec919f24.mp4?t=1761423635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>17 Unique Weapons</strong> – Flamethrowers, rocket launchers, sniper rifles, and more. Build your perfect loadout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 Playable Characters</strong> – Each with their own traits. Find your favorite survivor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20 Ranks to Climb</strong> – Unlock rewards, perks, and upgrades with every level gained.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15+ Perks</strong> – Mix and match to create devastating builds: offensive, defensive, and everything in between.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>16+ Enemy Types</strong> – Face horrors from The Other World with deadly attack patterns and evolving behaviors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Distinct Levels</strong> – Battle through terrifying environments aboard the Sea of Dreams.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Custom Game Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat the campaign to unlock a fully tweakable experience. Adjust everything—from difficulty to weapon count, enemy scaling, and more. Create your own challenge or total chaos. <strong>Your nightmare, your rules.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Difficulty Settings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're here for the story or the pain, choose from multiple difficulty levels—<strong>Easy to Legendary</strong>. Higher risk, greater rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The nightmare begins. Will you survive the Sea of Dreams?</p>",
